sequenceDiagram
    participant Cam as RTSP Camera
    participant Cap as FrameCapture
    participant Mot as MotionDetector (MOG2)
    participant Veh as VehicleDetector (YOLOv11)
    participant Plt as PlateDetector (YOLOv5)
    participant OcrE as OCR Engine (PaddleOCR + comparators)
    participant Trk as ByteTrack
    participant Slot as SlotMapper
    participant Evt as EventEmitter
    participant Q as SQLite Queue
    participant BE as Backend check-vehicle API

    Cam->>Cap: raw frame
    Cap->>Cap: validate frame + throttle (~200ms)
    Cap->>Mot: frame
    alt no motion in ROI
        Mot-->>Cap: drop frame (GPU stages skipped)
    else motion detected
        Mot->>Veh: frame
        Veh->>Plt: vehicle crop(s) + bbox
        Plt->>OcrE: plate crop(s) after 4-orientation deskew retry
        OcrE->>OcrE: PaddleOCR primary, EasyOCR / VietOCR / legacy YOLOv5-char run as comparators
        OcrE->>Trk: plate string + bbox + confidence
        Trk->>Trk: assign or continue track_id
        Trk->>Slot: track_id + vehicle reference point
        Slot->>Slot: point-in-polygon lookup -> slot_id
        Slot->>Evt: PlateRecognized / VehicleDetected / VehicleEntered|VehicleRelocated candidate
        Evt->>Evt: apply cooldown + min-detection-duration confirmation
        Evt->>Q: enqueue event (event_id, occurredAt)
        Q->>BE: POST /api/vehicles/check-vehicle (X-Gate-Key)
        BE-->>Q: 200 OK ack
        Q->>Q: dequeue on ack, retry with exponential backoff on failure
    end
